; Cow — AnimalDefinition data entry (gdd.md -> Data Schemas / Content Architecture).
; Roster row: roster.md -> Already-Defined Roster | Ruled: decisions.md -> D-43.
; Asset: Quaternius "Ultimate Animated Animal Pack", CC0 1.0 Universal — see
;   project/attribution/sources/quaternius_ultimate_animated_animals.tres.
;
; SPECIES: domestic cattle (Bos taurus). Same real species as Bull — no ecological basis
; to split habitat axes, so Cow and Bull share identical habitat_needs/personality/
; farm_tolerant by design (D-43); they already share a base mesh in the imported asset
; (content-pipeline-status.md's flagged shared-mesh risk), and the human ruled 2026-07-26
; to keep both as separate roster spots regardless.
;
; CAPACITY FIELDS (D-43): capacity_radius = 0 -> SENTINEL `CAPACITY_RADIUS_FOLLOWS_SCOUT`,
; meaning "equal to scout_radius" (8), not a radius of zero. tiles_per_individual = 5
; (vs. Bull's 6 — a bull kept singly needs more room than a cow in a herd; explicitly
; acknowledged in D-43 as the thin, one-number-only distinction between the two).
; max_individuals = 6. Farm-tolerant.
;
; fact_text is docs/content/cleared-pool-fact-cards.md § Cow's CORRECTED proposed line,
; transcribed verbatim — all four checklist steps PASS there. This replaced an earlier
; draft naming Holstein black-and-white spots, which a 2026-08-06 consistency-check pass
; found did not match the imported Cow.gltf's materials (solid brown/tan, no black or
; white body material, no pattern texture) — see the source file's full correction note.
;   "coat can come in many colors — black, white, reddish brown, or brown" -> ADW Bos
;   taurus, "Physical Description": "The body is covered in short hair, the color of which
;   varies from black through white, reddish brown, and brown."
; https://animaldiversity.org/accounts/Bos_taurus/
;
; news_reports intentionally empty — News Report pools for this pool are a separate, later
; purchase (not part of Content Pipeline step 4/5 for this dispatch).
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="AnimalDefinition" load_steps=3 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/definitions/animal_definition.gd" id="1_schema"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/animals/cow/Cow.tscn" id="2_model"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_schema")
id = "cow"
display_name = "Cow"
habitat_needs = Array[String](["cultivated", "open_grass"])
personality = "Bold"
avoids = Array[String]([])
farm_tolerant = true
scout_radius = 8
capacity_radius = 0
tiles_per_individual = 5
max_individuals = 6
model_scenes = Array[PackedScene]([ExtResource("2_model")])
fact_text_pool = Array[String](["A cow's short coat can come in many colors — black, white, reddish brown, or brown — so no two cows have to match."])
news_reports = Array[String]([])
